|-----------|--------------|----------------------|-------|
| **Point lookup** (`col = value`) | **O(log n)** | **O(1)** average | B-Tree height grows logarithmically with rows. |
| **Range scan** (`col BETWEEN x AND y`) | **O(log n + k)** | Not'
